---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-950">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- Brand -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <img
            src="/librehub.png"
            alt="LibreHub logo"
            class="h-8 w-auto object-contain"
            width="32"
            height="32"
          />
          <span class="font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Ανακάλυψε καλύτερα εργαλεία</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          Κατάλογος ελεύθερου και ανοιχτού κώδικα λογισμικού (ΕΛ/ΛΑΚ) για κάθε ανάγκη.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-600">
          Αναπτύσσεται από τον
          <a href="https://eiosifidis.blogspot.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Blog Ευσταθίου Ιωσηφίδη (ανοίγει σε νέα καρτέλα)" class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 hover:underline">Ευστάθιο Ιωσηφίδη</a>
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/iosifidis/librehub.gr"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            aria-label="Αποθετήριο του LibreHub στο GitHub (ανοίγει σε νέα καρτέλα)"
            title="GitHub"
            class="inline-flex items-center text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-500 dark:hover:text-gray-200 transition-colors"
          >
            <svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.53 1.032 1.53 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Links -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Πλοήγηση</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><a href="/" class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-green-600 dark:hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">Αρχική</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#categories" class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-green-600 dark:hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">Κατηγορίες</a></li>
          <li><a href="/suggest" class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-green-600 dark:hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">Προτείνετε Λογισμικό</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Resources -->
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Πόροι</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li>
            <a href="https://mathe.ellak.gr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Μάθε ΕΕΛΛΑΚ (ανοίγει σε νέα καρτέλα)" class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-green-600 dark:hover:text-green-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
              Μάθε ΕΕΛΛΑΚ
              <svg class="h-3 w-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://opensource.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Open Source Initiative (ανοίγει σε νέα καρτέλα)" class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-green-600 dark:hover:text-green-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
              Open Source Initiative
              <svg class="h-3 w-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="https://www.gnu.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GNU Project (ανοίγει σε νέα καρτέλα)" class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-green-600 dark:hover:text-green-400 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1">
              GNU Project
              <svg class="h-3 w-3" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-600">
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} LibreHub &mdash;
        Κώδικας: <a href="https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="AGPL-3.0 άδεια (ανοίγει σε νέα καρτέλα)" class="hover:underline">AGPL-3.0</a> &middot;
        Περιεχόμενο: <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 άδεια (ανοίγει σε νέα καρτέλα)" class="hover:underline">CC BY-NC-SA 4.0</a>
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-gray-400 dark:text-gray-600">
        <span>Φτιαγμένο με</span>
        <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Astro framework (ανοίγει σε νέα καρτέλα)" class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 hover:underline">Astro</a>
        <span>&amp;</span>
        <a href="https://tailwindcss.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Tailwind CSS (ανοίγει σε νέα καρτέλα)" class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 hover:underline">Tailwind CSS</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
